# Superpowers SDD working artifacts — execution ledgers, task briefs/reports and
# review diffs. Agent scratch, not project history. One file predated the
# tool's own .gitignore and rode along tracked for months; ignoring the root
# stops that recurring, since an ignore rule never untracks what is already in.
/.superpowers/
